# Halt on changing types for tests

HALT IMMEDIATELY if a test, generate, version, e2e, or compile failure would be “fixed” by editing `types.yaml`, datasource types, view types, dictionary shapes, fields, references, tags, or includes — without first notifying the user and getting explicit approval.

Do not drop, rename, retarget, or weaken authored types to silence an error. Fix the code, test, or generator instead. If a type change seems required, stop and say so.
